      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Get the enrolment link",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Fleet, open your <strong>preparation</strong> team and choose <strong>Add hosts</strong>, then <strong>Android</strong>. Copy the link to the phones. A phone Fleet has seen before keeps its old team and its old name: transfer it to the preparation team first, and give it a new name below.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/be65720cb87b22b7.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 1326
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open the link on the phone",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open the link and tap <strong>Enroll</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/13980932ec6c3a74.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Set up the work profile",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Next</strong>, and <strong>Continue</strong> if asked.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e7f89bb3db7e6a4b.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Accept",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Accept &#x26; continue</strong>, then <strong>Next</strong> if asked, and wait a minute.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e0d676c54c6c7569.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Done",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Done</strong>. The apps arrive in the work profile.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6ff5b74a5a7be991.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Name each phone",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Fleet, open the phone's host, choose <strong>Edit user</strong> and type its callsign, such as <code>OTTER4</code>: 3–32 letters, digits or hyphens. <strong>Save</strong>. Renaming a phone that already has its certificate gives it a second callsign; revoke the old one in Deploy App.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/864752cd63281309.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 1150
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
